{"4747280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sunset Survival: Miami", "steam_appid": 4747280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Miami. Enjoy the sun, the palms, and the flesh-eating mutants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is completely warped, and every single alley is a death trap. But that’s exactly where the best loot is hiding. Pack some serious firepower, grab everything that isn't bolted down, and blast through anything in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is the game for the bravest, or in this case, the crazy ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/b98db98d423536d2943c7fe746233711.poster.avif?t=1782305546\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/b98db98d423536d2943c7fe746233711.webm?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/b98db98d423536d2943c7fe746233711.mp4?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sun, Palms &amp; Mutants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are still remains of the city that once was, but now with new layer of destruction. Luxury hotels are now infected nests, the beaches are mutant sand pits... and some zones have mutated so badly. No sane person would come here. Luckily, that doesn't apply to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/2c1ef8a520a078fc0c49972f506af694.poster.avif?t=1782305546\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/2c1ef8a520a078fc0c49972f506af694.webm?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/2c1ef8a520a078fc0c49972f506af694.mp4?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight, Scavenge, Repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no shame in running. Your only goal is to make it out alive, whatever it takes. Tear through narrow back alleys, rip open abandoned ambulances, and check the toilets, you might find a high-tier rifle, or you might just find a warm can of old beer. Either way, you're gonna need it. Random loot, varied enemies, and unpredictable weather mean no two runs go the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/eeb6ed87f06dacad822868091a2a9af6.poster.avif?t=1782305546\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/eeb6ed87f06dacad822868091a2a9af6.webm?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/eeb6ed87f06dacad822868091a2a9af6.mp4?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go Inside (If You Dare)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just stick to the streets. Break into hotels, bars, and neon-lit nightclubs. The deeper you go, the bigger the danger gets, but that's where the best loot is waiting. Keep an eye out for intel on the area so you know exactly what kind of hell you're walking into.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/bc420f306567938a3736f855e9efb91b.poster.avif?t=1782305546\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/bc420f306567938a3736f855e9efb91b.webm?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/bc420f306567938a3736f855e9efb91b.mp4?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Nightlife</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miami is dangerous by day, but a total nightmare after dark. If you aren't heavily geared, do not stay out past sunset. When the lights go out, the worst monsters crawl out of the shadows, the city goes pitch black, and you're left relying entirely on a flashlight battery that will run out. But the dark is also when the rarest loot can be found. Do you risk it all, or play it safe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/b2268102625e52eed34eebd6c3b625f8.poster.avif?t=1782305546\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/b2268102625e52eed34eebd6c3b625f8.webm?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/b2268102625e52eed34eebd6c3b625f8.mp4?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape or Die</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't win until you get out. Fight your way back to your boat, defend a  chopper helipad, or strap yourself to a lawn chair rigged with propane tanks. It doesn't matter how you leave, just don't die, because if you do, everything you found stays in the dirt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/ab0eacb8914d9df155cc69c11a0657cd.poster.avif?t=1782305546\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/ab0eacb8914d9df155cc69c11a0657cd.webm?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/ab0eacb8914d9df155cc69c11a0657cd.mp4?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Home Sweet Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only place you can feel truly safe, your island paradise. Bring back resources to upgrade your base, build new structures, and repair old ones. Improving your home base will attract more survivors, unlock new skills, and let you permanently upgrade your stats. Once you are ready, sleep until morning and head back toward Miami.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/71e96f97aa4a85994d31f0ba17d7727a.poster.avif?t=1782305546\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/71e96f97aa4a85994d31f0ba17d7727a.webm?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/71e96f97aa4a85994d31f0ba17d7727a.mp4?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined Miami streets and dangerous interiors, including bars, hotels, nightclubs, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against diverse mutant enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and improve your home base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive arsenal of different firearms and melee weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats and unlock  new skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and day and night cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests  and earn  rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/3520a81fbd9566d5569a12e36e837bca.poster.avif?t=1782305546\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/3520a81fbd9566d5569a12e36e837bca.webm?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747280/extras/3520a81fbd9566d5569a12e36e837bca.mp4?t=1782305546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunset Survival: Miami</strong> is developed by a passionate two-person core team. We are striving to make it the best experience possible. If you like what you see, please add the game to your Wishlist, it would mean the world to us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ajvar Studio</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Miami. Enjoy the sun, the palms, and the flesh-eating mutants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is completely warped, and every single alley is a death trap. But that’s exactly where the best loot is hiding. Pack some serious firepower, grab everything that isn't bolted down, and blast through anything in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival is the game for the